  "details": "Backspace button either duplicates or deletes then entire line of text when theres 3 or more new lines in bio\nHow to replicate:\nEdit the bio and write:\ntest1\ntest2\ntest3\nMove with the arrows key to the end of second line (test2)\nPress backspace with the ingame keyboard. Letter gets deleted but it also duplicates the second line and pastes it at the end.\nAdding even more new lines causes different issues.\nhttps://streamable.com/fhp6fx",
